null,null,["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKMlMxTk5NVEUwTjNOaFIwRkNibDgyZGtoRFRFRRAB"]],"CIABIhBEaUHZbA4GcdzatZC6Gaog",1]],null,null,null,[[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3YcHCG8oAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCG4oBg",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCHAoBw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCHEoCA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCHIoCQ",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3YcHCHQoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCHMoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3YcHCHYoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiuqrXQwNKWAxW8evUHHW8VBd4Q3IcHCHUoCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["間在興南夜市裡的人氣其實蠻高的，第一次來吃整體感受是——有特色，但真的很看口味。\n\n先講湯頭，他們主打雞白湯，走的是偏濃厚路線，入口是有明顯的膠質感跟油脂香氣，喝起來蠻順的，但同時也偏油一點。如果你平常喜歡豚骨那種重口味，應該會蠻喜歡；但如果是偏好清爽拉麵的人，可能喝到後面會覺得有點膩。\n\n黑蒜口味是這間比較多人推的，蒜香會把整個湯頭層次拉起來，比原味更耐吃一點。\n\n麵條是細麵，吸湯效果不錯，整體搭配起來是OK的。雞叉燒是走舒肥路線，口感蠻嫩的，不會乾柴，算是加分。溏心蛋也有一定水準，不會雷。\n\n不過環境就比較現實一點，畢竟是在夜市裡，用餐空間就是簡單座位，夏天會偏悶熱，整體舒適度沒辦法跟一般拉麵店比。\n\n價格部分算親民，以這個濃度跟用料來說，CP值是有的。",null,[0,40]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLTWxNeFRrNU5WRVV3VGpOT2FGSXdSa05pYkRneVpHdG9SRlJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328